{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "944d1903-cd23-49ca-9b0d-2fc73bfcfd30"/*SetContextTexture*/,
  "Description": "Stores a texture in the evaluation context for the connected subgraph, where it can be accessed by [GetTextureFromContext].\n\nThis is used internally, e.g. by [SetEnvironment], to pass textures to draw operators without connecting them directly. If no texture is connected, a white pixel is used.\n\nSee also: [GetTextureFromContext]",
